==Battleground==
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Back]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Survive and deplete all peons. Use any units that outrange or can do chip damage to Bears Be Back such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

